How should I explain this to her ...
I just tried your shower system, no offense, it's terrible. Where is Jane? Is that her diary?
Claire ... I ... 
 ... She abandoned me, right?
Claire, listen to me. Jane would never abandon you. Plus, you are not alone.
You? What can YOU do? Even I need to look after you ... 
Poor Claire ... I should find something to do ... Maybe fix this radio, so I can get more information ... 
First, I need some planks.
I hope it will be useful ...
I don't want to be trapped here any longer ...
Nothing. Wrong wiring maybe ... 
(Sound of some signals is coming from the Radio)
I got a signal! And it sounds like people! Hello, are you guys a rescue team?
I have to tell Jane ...
That's a Big Ol' Crocodile!
We can't get the radio with her being there! What should we do?
There's a piece of a plane on top of the crocodile. Perhaps we could ... 
Geez, that was too close. That croc almost got you. You must stay alive for me ... 
All thanks to that plane!
I think I have to get inside to fetch it for you.
Hope there's something useful in that suitcase
This coconut should be able to cure my thirst ...
I should find something to protect myself with.
I have what I need, it's time to go back
Damn! Nearby Mutants have been alerted and are heading our way!
We can't let these Mutants enter our camp!
Woot! That was close! Let's get going!
This place is incredible!
Looks like another adventurer ...
I need to be careful of those wild boars.
That's why he's called Short Vincent. He is only half the size of me ... 
All of that Big Guy Shay's friends are so weird. I need to be more careful with that guy.
Damn it! That Big Guy Shay turned out to be an enormous Mutant. He has been luring me here since the beginning. 
Oh God, is that a velociraptor? I should go check it out.
So this is the velociraptor's den? An egg! Incredible!
I'll take care of the egg later. Now I must hurry up and find Claire.
Look like I opened the wrong Mystery Box.
It looks like Claire's ...
A male footprint; it's Jack's!
I guess I'm on the right track!
What was that sound?
There's something odd about these trees ...
There's something on them! Could they be the parts Erick told me about?
There are too many guards. I have to get prepared.
It looks like a place for hiding something ...
I sense a grave danger with these parts.
Looks like it packs a punch. Maybe I should use it to get through the obstacles.
They look like ammonium nitrate explosives. He is giving me these as a reward. People from ORU are insane.
I can try moving the oil barrel over to blow it up or try grenades.
I got it!
I should take this opportunity to find that "crazy woman"
Isn't here.
Not here either. I need to move quicker.
This is it!
Don't blame me, blame Erick ...
Jane! I have to put out the fire!
The poison gas should be gone by now.
Jane, get out! I'll hold them off!
Is this Jane's blood?
It's still fresh ...
She seems to be injured.
This is not good! I must move faster!
What happened! I should better be prepared……
Gotta remove the trees that are blocking my way.
Claire, wait. Jack, I hope you are not making a mistake.
I should go and ask Jane what's going on.
I need to shoot the oil barrel to blow up the obstacles!
Maybe he's hiding in the lab?
Damn it, the door is locked! I need to find a way around ... 
These people are out of their minds ... wait, a scream?! Coming from that researcher!
Everyone is gone. Where did they go?
Done! One more to go!
There shouldn't be any poisonous fog anymore.
Done. All Biotoxins left in the room will be cleared out.
This should prevent such tragedies from happening again, at least for now ...
Virus injected. Hopefully it works.
Ok, the other one should be at the Central Altar ...
Now I need to take Claire and get out of here! Whatever happened between them, not my business anymore ... 
Let's keep on going and find Claire ...
This should be the Access Card William talked about
Not here, let's look elsewhere
I hope that wasn't too much
This is where Atlanteans used to live
Shoot, they are too fast!
Just as she said. It's here.
Claire! Where are you?
Jane ... It will be alright
Damn it! There are too many of them!
The Gate has been activated. I must break through! 
This sign ... Is this a road or runway?
Wrecked vehicles, full of marks from collisions and burns
The identifier lights seem to be functional ...
Claire, come take a look!
A forklift ... unfortunately it's completely broken.
Another forklift, the engine is missing though.
Sounds like we've got survivors!
No one's on the bus.
Seems to be working still.
Another plane ...
Can't open, perhaps try looking through the window ...
The strange mechanical noise is getting louder, I have a bad feeling about this ...
Here we are, the Broken Terminal ...
The monsters are attracted by light, be careful and stay in the dark ...
Hello! Anyone here?
Looks like no one's here ...
Not sure if Claire is doing well over there ...
Something seems off up ahead ...
Burning flames, yet not hot at all. Strange ... 
Neither is this one, can't even boil eggs with this. How peculiar ...
That's ... Monitor?
This door is locked, it can't be opened from this side ...
It's broken ... can't be opened from here either.
When did this door ... open?
Nothing seems to be special around here ...
Finally got out ...
Hey! Stop! Stop running!
It seems Rothschild is not here ...
Aha, found you! Rothschild!
I think it's a good idea to make a nest for this egg.
I guess this is the spot! Hope it likes the temperature here. 
