But they didn't, and at least for the time being, we don't need to worry about electromagnetic storms anymore.
At this rate, it's only a matter of time until you get us into big trouble!
Believe me, it won't come to that. Hey, let's talk about something positive. Zhu Lan has almost recovered, I've heard she can move around on her own now. Why don't we pay her a visit?
Hey, looks like you are doing well.
Thank you, Neva.\n<She turns to Arthur>\nI heard from Alizée that you saved me. Thank you!
You are very welcome, my lady.
Don't worry, Zhu Lan recovery is quite promising. Now we should focus on more important matters.
What's that? Another electromagnetic storm?
It's worse than an electromagnetic storm, you fool! Do you really think those who caused the storm will suddenly grow a conscience and stop their madness?
<She regards you with a chilly gaze> Erick got in touch with me. They're now gearing up to go further down into the Core.
Just "gearing up".
That's right, you'd better go join them. I'll gather more people and head to the earth's core later.
Eric, ready to head deeper into the Core?
Yes, we kinda confirmed that the area under our feet won't threaten human life. The only question is, how to get down there?
But how did Alma and her followers do it?
They got help from those treacherous temple overseers! Damn it, stop asking these boring questions! Come and meet Smith, he will create a passage downwards.
It's a pleasure to meet you, Smith.
The pleasure is mine. I've heard a lot about you.
Do we have to waste our precious time on pleasantries?
Alright, let's get down to business. In fact, I'm planning to install a lifting system for the transportation of personnel and goods.
What do you need me to do?
Simple. Help me find some materials, a lot of them in fact. I will give you a list of what we need.
These should be enough for us.
Almost, but we're still short of a few more essential materials.
Alright, hand me the list. I'll go for another run.
Everything's ready now.
Do you mean we are good to go.
Of course. Let's go!
We are finally here.
We should've been here earlier.
At least it's not too late!
Not early enough either. Look, it seems Alma has prepared some kind of welcoming ceremony for us.
Christina, Shana? How come you are here?
We received the messages from Alizée. Who would have thought what happened here on the island could unleash the apocalypse.
Jesus! Can someone tell me how many people has this Alma deceived?
I have no idea. But looks like there are tons of them. What's scarier is that they follow her every word.
Hey, you can leave this to us. It's best if you go back and check out over there! Sounds like some kind of battle!
Damn it! Those monsters won't stop coming from the west!
The treacherous temple overseers are helping Alma.
I don't care where they come from.
Listen, I've got an idea. I'll make a few defensive turrets, and you help me out, will you?
Just leave it to me!
OK Let's go!
Well, that should do it.
Wow! Well done!
Thank you. Now head back and find Baak. I'll keep an eye on things here.
Great, the western front has been stabilized.
Let's track down Alma next.
More importantly, we need to find out what Alma is doing.
We will investigate the terminals that are still running.
There are no traces of Alma's activity.
What has been recorded here?
Some...Oh my, there are records of events in the Mirror Palace here. Let me take a look..."
We'd better discuss about this with Erick.
What have you found?
We found some information about the Mirror Palace.
Oh! Interesting! Based on Ethan's research, the Mirror Palace is a key structure created for suppressing Omichli. Yet I have no clue how it works!
Well, this is indeed a sophisticated structure. To put it simple, you can think of the Mirror Palace as a Tokamak Reactor.
Tokamak? Did you mean the Mirror Palace can drain power from Omichli and restrain it in the process? Like using electromagnetic energy generated by nuclear fusion to confine the fusion?
That's about right. It involves countless basic applications and calculations at multiple levels of principles.
Damn it, no wonder the Mirror Palace malfunctioned just because of an electromagnetic storm. Do we even have the technology to fix it?
I'm not sure. Perhaps we can. Hopefully we can find more info about it.
Don't forget about Alma, guys.
