Oceane has crafted components sturdy enough to stabilize the Mirror Palace. According to her, I need only install these parts at the Palace's weakest points to ensure its continued, steady operation. No time to lose—let's head to the Mirror Palace!
The Mirror Palace is teeming with all manner of monsters the likes of which have never been seen before. They appear to have thrived here for tens of thousands of years, and dealing with them will be no easy task. But if the ancient Atlanteans could do it, so can I!
It's him—Omichli, the source of all chaos! Just one glance, and it felt like my very soul was being torn apart... Yet, despite that, I will bring him to an end! Save this world! And bracing a brilliant future!
