Ah, you've arrived.
In fact, Robert and I have come up with a way to lift the electromagnetic barrier. But the problem is, we need some specific materials.
Cracking the ancient Atlantis technology is no simple task. We need a vast array of intricate items. It would be wise for us to split up and search separately.
No problem, just give me an item list.
I've got everything you need on the list.
We made good progress with our collecting endeavors as well. Alright, I'll work on it right away!
Let's meet up at the Core.
Have you found a way?
Indeed we have. We created a high-energy electromagnetic interference device. We just need to activate it using the crystals nearby, and that should disable the electromagnetic barrier.
However, those guys over there seem quite dangerous.
You're right, we should prepare for combat. Once the barrier gets disabled, a tough battle will be inevitable.
Don't worry, we will help.
Next...
Next we attack, attack, and attack! We mustn't waste any more time!
Hey, don't be so reckless. We shouldn't underestimate Alma...
That's right. We can't afford to waste any more time. Our time is running out, and we'd better hurry.
Thanks for your help, who are you? I've never met you on the island before.
I'm the daughter of the sea, you may call me... Oceane. But that's not important, what matters is our objectives are aligned, so I will help you.
Why should I believe you, you could be working with Alma.
<She looked shocked>\nNo, we can trust her.
How do you know that, Claire?
Just believe me, we can trust her.
Thank you for your trust, Claire.
What's going on?
We can talk about this later. According to the information on the terminal, Alma has already started harnessing the power of Omichli, and used such power to "evolve" her followers.
Jesus Christ! That B**ch is insane!
So, you must act quickly, and I'll help you.
Is this the power obtained from human... "evolution"?
Perhaps.
Did you see that? They are carrying some sealed crates.
What's with these injectables?
A mutagen, a bio drug created by Alma with the properties of Omichli.
Is this how Alma plans to induce human evolution?
This is just the beginning.
Damn it! These guys are insane! They plan to blow up the entire platform!
They are crazy, and their leader, Alma, is a complete maniac!
If she wasn't, how could she possibly think of using the power of Omichli to evolve the human race?
Our enemy has installed multiple remote detonation bombs throughout the platform. If we draw their attention, they may detonate the bombs at any moment.
I can use electromagnetic interference to prevent remote detonation.
Sounds like a good plan! Let's get started. Best of luck everyone!
The good news is that there is only one bomb left to disarm. The bad news is they have detected something wrong and decided to detonate the bomb with a timing device.
So we need to deal with all the enemies before they install the timing device?
Exactly, let's go!
Good thing we acted quickly.
Thankfully yeah. Or my island adventure would have ended right here.
Nice sense of humor, but we must hurry up. Alma surely has more tricks up her sleeves.
This path directly leads to the Mirror Palace. You are familiar with it right?
If you are talking about the place for imprisoning Omichli, then yes.
Then you should know Alma is merely a delusional scientist. The real threat to the world lies within Omichli itself.
Of course, we must deal with Alma first before coming up with a plan against Omichli.
I hope you know what you are facing. Check out the terminal here. There are some important records from Atlanteans.
Apparently, Alma's followers know how important these records are.
Surely they do. But I didn't expect to find the blueprint for the Mirror Palace.
This blueprint may help us restore the Mirror Palace and imprison Omichli once again... Hold on, I heard someone.
Why are you still here?
Cecile? What's happening?
Those Alma's followers have gone insane, our forces are surrounded!
We must help them!
I'll stay here and copy the blueprint for restoring the Mirror Palace.
Are you guys OK?
I'm alright, thank you! But many others are still in danger, please help them!
and you Jack?
I'm OK, you should help others!
Well, upright apes finally came for my rescue!
Shut up! You freaking ancient e-waste! I appreciate the help guys, we'll take it from here!
Careful old man. You are risking your life here!
Thank you! We wouldn't make it if not for you!
Aww, thanks a lot for your help! Love you guys!
You're welcome. I did what I should.
Wonderful! Seems like everyone is fine.
I think I caught sight of Alma over there. We are getting really close.
Then what are waiting for? Let's catch that crazy b**ch!
At last, you've caught up.
Alma! You can't run from this!
Why should I run? Do you even understand what I'm doing? I'm giving humanity a chance, a opportunity to break free and transcend above the gods!
You will only bring destruction to this world!
What a pity! Seems like you just don't listen. Well then, let's end this pointless debate for I'll end you in my way!
I'm sure she will start her final move soon. We must hurry!
Of course. I know it without you telling me!
Rally round me! The fate of our future rests upon our united strength!
Damn it! How many dumbass did Alma manage to deceive?
Probably 90% of the surviving members of the scientific research team? How many people did you have?
Not important! Not Important! We must press on!
I know! But you as a non-combatant should stay back now!
Another bridge rigged with high voltage!
We can deal with them right?
Excellent. Half of the team will stay here to ensure this bridge isn't destroyed, while the other half will go with you to deal with the electricity. Hurry!
Seems fine, same routine as before.
I can't wait to take down Alma. I wish I could grow up in one second and kick her ass!
We've dealt with the high voltage on the bridge.
Great! Apparently we have another tough fight after crossing the bridge.
Let's hope this is the final battle.
I wouldn't be that optimistic.
Seems like Alma has nowhere to run.
I'll avenge for you, Jane.
<Teeth gnashing>
So, let's move out.
Alma... Are you...? What did you do?
I suppose you are talking about my body. This is merely the first stage of evolution, and our human flesh is a price that must be paid!
You are crazy Alma! You are completely crazy!
Perhaps, yet I succeeded. The fact is, each stage of evolution progress has proven to be controllable.
I'll give you one last chance. Join me, and we'll lead our civilization into a new stage!
You mean, a human civilization without humans?
Foolish arrogance! Have you ever considered that the essence of civilization doesn't necessarily have to be human? Humanity is merely an hollow, disposable noun.
No! I won't accept your so-called civilization. All you do is lead the world into destruction! Besides, you shall pay for what you did to Jane!
So you've all made your choice? Well, then there's nothing more to say. Decisions bow to power, and power stems from violence. Time for you to submit to my power! 
Alma, you lost.
Mwahaha... I... I lost. My life will soon come to an end.
That doesn't mean I'm wrong!
You are a group of stubborn conservatives, like ostriches burying their heads in the sand, unable to see the threats facing humanity. All you desire is to pass each day in peace, without any change or taking any risks.
What are you talking about Alma?
Do you really think that Omichli is the only one of its kind in the universe? When they eventually arrive, what options will unprepared humans have?
Foolish humans... Go and take a look at my research records... Perhaps you will realize what a grace mistake you've made...
Shut up! Your trickery won't work on us! Go to hell! Even if Satan shows your mercy, I won't, and neither would Jane!
She died, Jack. We've avenged for Jane.
Omichli is not the only one of its kind? Is that... possible?
Let's check Alma's research records.
Oh my god. Omichli is the embodiment of one of the cosmic principles? That means...
Does this mean that someday Newton's third law will also manifest as entities descending upon Earth? Don't be paranoid, Erick, it's as unlikely as experiencing a plane crash.
If I remember correctly, you ended up on this island from a plane crash.
Well... the chances of the same thing happening is way too low. Let's focus on how to deal with Omichli.
Let's hope Oceane can find a way.
You are finally here. Let me guess, Alma is no longer a problem for us.
Yes, she died.
Another life has passed away.
Hey, she deserved it!
Perhaps, but we shouldn't dwell on it. I have obtained the complete set of blueprints of Mirror Palace, and I have a plan to restore it.
I'll consult with scientists in Salvation Town to devise a final action plane. I hope you can join us.
