Elite Pass:\nRewards: Production Medal Points, Battle Medal Points, Gas, Parts, grenades, bonus Coins and Crystals\nComplete daily, weekly, and monthly quests to help you quickly unlock more rewards!\nActivate Elite Pass to obtain all the advanced items! You can only activate one per event period!
Survivor Pass\n1. Survivor Pass Period: Each Survivor Pass Season lasts for a month. \n2. Rewards Reset: The rewards will reset when a new Survivor Pass period starts, <color=#fee685>make sure to claim your rewards prior to the reset</color>.\n3. Survivor Pass Quests: \nDaily Quests: These quests reset every day. Completing them to earn player XP and pass XP. \nWeekly QuestsThese quests reset every week. Completing them to earn lots of pass XP.\nMonthly Quests: These quests are available once during each Survivor Pass period. Completing them to earn lots of pass XP.\n4. Pass Level: Completing Pass Quests or spend Crystals to increase Pass Level. \n5. Courage Pass Rewards: Battle Medals, Prodoction Medals along with various materials are rewarded upon leveling up your Pass Level. \n6. Elite Pass Rewards: Players who activated their Elite Pass can unlock a rare mount, in addition to getting Advanced Battle Medals, Advanced Production Medals, Crystals, Treasure Hunt Tokens etc. \n7. Courage Chest: Courage Chest, which contains Island Coins or Medal Points, can be obtained even after reaching the max level. \n8. Medals: Battle Medals, Production Medals and their advanced variants can only be used during the current Survivor Pass period, so use them before they expire.
