1. Requirement: After your character reaches <color=#fee685>Lv.16</color>, you can talk to <color=#fee685>Mack</color> in <color=#fee685>Salvation Town</color> to enter the Arena.\n2. Battle Rules: in the Arena, you can battle with other survivors, and <color=#fee685>earn Victory Points for each victory.</color>\n3. Results Reward: The <color=#fee685>Results Reward</color> will be given out after each season based on the number of Victory Points earned. \n4. Point Reward: if you have 0 to 350 Victory Points, then you can <color=#fee685>pick up the reward once</color>. If you earned more than 350 Victory Points, then the reward <color=#fee685>will reset each season.</color>\n5. Point Reset: At the end of the season, if you have less or equal to 350 Victory Points, then your points will <color=#fee685>remain the same</color>, but if you have more than 350 Victory Points, then your Victory Points will reset based on <color=#fee685>the reset rules</color>.\n6. Gear Durability: the <color=#fee685>Gear and Weapon Durability Cost</color> in the Arena is decreased by 90%.\n7. Settling Period: the settling starts 5 minutes before a season ends. You will not be able to match other survivors during this period.
