Module Details: \nModule Upgrade\n1.Upgrading Modules will increase the attribute bonuses they provide.\n2. Upgrading consumes Modular Chips or other Modules. \n3. If an upgraded module is used as upgrade material for another module, 25% of XP will be lost. \n\nModule Learning\n1.Two modules of the same type can go through the Module Learning process to change the type of bonus attributes provided. \n2. Learning will randomly select bonus attributes from ones on the two existing modules. \n3. You may choose whether or not to keep the Learning outcome.\n4. The module used as material will be consumed and 75% of its previously gained XP will be returned in the form of Modular Chips.
Module Details: \n1. Various modules can be obtained from Joint Hunt and certain Treasure Hunts. \n2. Equipped modules provide Basic Attributes and Incremental Attributes. \n3. Attribute bonuses increase with module quality. \n4. The module slot must be unlock before any module can be slotted in, and each slot can only be equipped with certain types of modules.
