A small Island drifted away from the main Island, nice weather, very few people have discovered it due to some unknown reasons; A scientist established Lab 0 at this place, perhaps all the abnormalities came from this place
Shoal Region is mostly made of gray sand and rock mass, where the first group of survivors came here through. After a series of changes, the once beautiful beach has become what it is today 
