Season Battlefield Rules
1. Registration Rule: The Season Battlefield can only be registered and started by the <color="#fee685"> Camp leader</color> or the <color="#fee685">Camp Elder</color> each week. \n2. Faction Assignment: Your Camp will be <color="#fee685">assigned to either the Red or Blue</color> Faction. \n3. Points Rule: You can earn points by eliminating monsters, gathering, or defeating players from the opposite Faction; the points you and your Camp members earned in the battlefield will be <color="#fee685">added toward your Faction's total points</color>. \n4. Rewards Distribution: The final result will be judged based on your <color="#fee685">Faction's total points</color> at the end of the Season Battlefield; the winning side will receive additional rewards, while the losing side will only receive basic rewards. \n5. Rewards Qualification: You won't receive any rewards if neither of you nor your Camp members earned any points.
1. Registration Rule: The Season Battlefield can only be registered and started by the <color="#fee685"> Camp leader</color> or the <color="#fee685">Camp Elder</color> each week. \n2. Faction Assignment: Your Camp will be <color="#fee685">assigned to either the MIA or ORU</color> Faction. \n3. Battle Stage: Battle Stage consists of two phases, namely <color="#fee685">Resource Supply</color> and <color="#fee685">Battlefront</color>. \n4. Resource Supply: There are multiple objectives including Eliminate Monsters, Gather Resources Turn in Resources. <color="#fee685">Complete those objectives to claim rewards</color>. \n5. Battlefront: <color="#fee685">Battlefront</color> starts after Resource Supply phase. The objective is to <color="#fee685">Destroy the Enemy's Crystals</color> in battle. \n6. Points Rule: You can earn points by eliminating monsters, gathering, defeating players from the opposite Faction, and by taking down your opponent's Main Crystal; the points you and your Camp members earned in the battlefield will be <color="#fee685">added to your Faction's total points</color>. \n7. Rewards Distribution: The final result <color="#fee685">will be judged based on your Faction's total points</color> at the end of the Season Battlefield; the winning side will receive additional rewards, while the losing side will only receive basic rewards. \n8. Rewards Qualification: You won't receive any rewards if neither of you or your Camp members earned any points.
