Background Story\nWhen talking about the origin of the Mutants on this island, survivors have been unable to reach a conclusion. Putting aside how a human was able to transform into a Mutant, there is an infinite number of Mutants on this island. It's almost impossible to have this many Mutants in one place at once, given the size of the island. \n People once joked that these Mutants came out of the ground. People just laughed at it. \n--It was not until the ORU posted a quest about finding the origin of the Mutant Horde, a team of survivors have found the origin, after avoiding the Mutant Horde on the way. Deep in the mountains, a nest that was built so deep inside appeared in front of these survivors. The last thing that these mercenaries saw was these legendary powerful monsters that once left their marks throughout this island, slowly walking out of their lair.
