1. <color="#fee685">Superior, Epic, and Legendary quality</color> gears that appear in the <color="#fee685">Volcano Region and afterwards</color> can get additional attributes through Gear Refinement. \n2. The higher quality the gear, the more attribute slots will be available for refining. In general, Superior quality has <color="#fee685">1 Slot</color>, Epic quality has <color="#fee685">2 Slots</color>, and Legendary quality has <color="#fee685">3 Slots</color>. \n3. All gears that are available for Refine has one initial refining attribute. Additional attribute slots can be obtained through <color="#fee685">Refine Expansion</color>. \n4. Refined attributes of the exact same gear type can be transferred through <color="#fee685">Refine Transfer</color>. \n5. A specific slot type can be locked when refining the gear, but its corresponding <color="#fee685">quality will be random when refining the gear in the next time</color>.\n6. The quality of attributes on a slot can also be locked <color="#fee685">which will keep the attribute in range of that quality, but the type and the exact number can still change</color>. Both locks can be activated at the same time to help you lock in your best attributes.
