1. Entry Rule: <color=#fee685>Solo only. Each entry costs one exploration point</color>. \n2. Exploration Point: You get <color=#fee685>1 exploration point per day</color>. <color=#fee685>Defeating a Mutant Leader</color> grants you one additional point. \n3. Exploration Rule: <color=#fee685>Pick the Mutant Leader to challenge</color> and defeat it to receive rewards. \n4.Endless Challenge: Upon defeating the last Mutant Leader, you can start the <color=#fee685>Endless Challenge</color>, where you attempt to deal as much <color=#fee685>damage</color> as possible to an unkillable Mutant Leader. Your <color=#fee685>best weekly damage record</color> in a run will be the basis of your rank in this mode, and you can repeat the mode for a higher record before the weekly results are finalized. \n5. Daily Reward: Deal enough damage to the Mutant Leader daily to get the reward. \n6. Milestone Reward: <color=#fee685>Defeat Mutant Leaders</color> a certain number of times to receive the reward. \n7. Ranking Rewards: There is a shared leaderboard regardless of your level. However, to give lower level players a chance, the rewards are sent to top players in each level brackets via mail. These <color=#fee685>special rewards</color> include <color=#fee685>Limited Event Titles</color> and other items. \n8. Unlock Rule: On each Monday, 10 Mutant Leaders will be selected <color=#fee685>based on player character's level</color> for players to challenge. <color=#fee685>Defeat the current Mutant Leader to unlock the next one</color>. \n9. Reset: Resets on Monday UTC 0:00. Result Calculation starts 30 minutes prior to resets, and the mode is unavailable during that period.
