Mutant Horde Invading
1. Attempts: You can enter the mode as many times as you want when the Mutant Horde Invasion is in progress. You may not enter if you have already repelled the horde or if the invasion timer has ended. \n2. Combat: Your goal is to repel the horde by protecting your Home Flag and eliminating all mutants. \n3. Rewards: You get rewards if you successfully repel the horde before the countdown ends. If you fail to do so before that, your home camp will be looted and you will lose part of your stored items.\n4. Refresh: Successfully repelling the mutant horde will allow you to take a break and prepare for the next horde, while failing to do so would cause the next horde to arrive immediately.
