Don't cry. Let's put the past behind alright? How about this, take this safe path to the downtown area of Salvation Town, and I'll be right back with some food. Okay?
Oh ... Okay, I really can't stay here anymore. Thank you, I truly mean it.
Look, I've got some cassowary meat for you. It's fully cooked but probably doesn't taste well without barbecue sauce.
Thank you so much! I don't know much about surviving in the wilds, in fact I'm so used to urban lifestyle that I have no clue what to do!
Don't worry, this island is massive. As long as you learn the basics, you won't find yourself starving again, however scarce the resources are.
Hopefully! Looks like it's time for me to start over! \nBy the way, did you notice something strange about this island?
