<color=#fee685>Event Rules:</color>\n1. The event consists of 3 consecutive phases: Resource Donation, Guardian Challenge, and Chest Opening.\n2. During the Resource Donation and Guardian Challenge phases, complete specific tasks to earn Individual Renown Points and Server Glory Points.\n3. Those two type of points corresponds to Individual Renown Points Leaderboard in this server and Server Glory Points Leaderboard in this region. \n4. After your server completes the first two phases, you can claim rewards from the Individual Renown Points Leaderboard during the Chest Opening phase. Server Glory Leaderboard rewards will be distributed via mail after the event ends.\n5. The top-ranked player on the Individual Renown Points Leaderboard will unlock the Server Surprise Chest, which all players on the server can open to claim rewards.\n6. Use your Individual Renown Points to exchange for items in the Renown Points Shop. All unused Points will be removed after the event – be sure to spend them before time runs out!\n7. If the Server Surprise Chest is not opened during the event, it will automatically open for all players once the event concludes.
