Blessing Gem Attribute
1. The primary combat slot, assuming it's unlocked and with a companion placed in, can equip companion blessing gem(s). \n2. There are five types of companion blessing gems, that can only be equipped in their corresponding slots. Blessing gem slots are unlocked after reaching specific ratings in the companion codex. \n3. Blessing gems come with basic attributes. The number and value of attribute modifiers increase when the gem reaches higher ranks. Advancing a blessing gem by one rank requires three gems of the same type and rank. The highest possible rank is Rank 6. \n4. Blessing gems can be refined with materials for more desired sets of attributes. A blessing gem can have up to 6 blessing attributes.
