Boss Rush
<color=#fee685>Mode Details: </color>\n1. This is a game mode with <color=#fee685>cross-server matchmaking</color> functionality, you may enter the mode solo or with a team. \n2. There are multiple difficulty tiers, each with its minimum character level requirement. \n3. The Bosses in this mode <color=#fee685>respawn at fixed intervals</color> every day. There are time limits for killing these bosses, failing to do so would result in their escape. \n4. The player under the effect of <color=#fee685>Reward Seeker</color> can get the dropped reward when the boss is killed. Those who teamed up with the player, if any, will be able to share the reward. <color=#fee685>Special Reminder: </color> You cannot get the dropped reward without teamed up with or being the Reward Seeker, even if you kill the Boss. \n5. <color=#fee685>To become the Reward Seeker</color>, you need to be the first player who deals damage to the boss, or kill the current Reward Seeker. \n6. The <color=#fee685>reward limit is shared across 6 difficulties tiers</color>, this includes both dropped reward and participation reward. You cannot continue to earn reward after reaching the limit, until it resets at 00:00 the next day. \n7. Each difficulty tier has its boss kill leaderboard, granting different ranking rewards.
<color=#fee685>Dropped Reward Details: </color>\n1. The player under the effect of <color=#fee685>Reward Seeker</color> can get the dropped reward when the boss is killed. Those who teamed up with the player, if any, will be able to share the reward. <color=#fee685>Special Reminder: </color> You cannot get the dropped reward without teamed up with or being the Reward Seeker, even if you kill the Boss. \n2. <color=#fee685>To become the Reward Seeker</color>, you need to be the first player who deals damage to the boss, or kill the current Reward Seeker. \n3. The reward limit is shared across 6 difficulties tiers, which reset at 00:00 the every day.
<color=#fee685>Participation Reward Details: </color>\n1. Participate and <color=#fee685>deal damage to the boss in a Boss Rush</color> to get daily participation reward. \n2. The reward limit is shared across 6 difficulties tiers, which reset at 00:00 the every day.
<color=#fee685>Boss Kill Leaderboard Details: </color>\n1. Each tier has its own boss kill leaderboard. Only your kills count, so it's not shared with team members. \n2. The leaderboard results are finalized at 00:00 every Monday, with the reward sent to your mailbox.
