<color=#fee685>Support Details: </color>\n1. During the Island Conquest event, players can spend Operation Points to support camps currently involved in territorial conquests. \n2. Support grants Personal Redeem Points, and the camps receiving Support will gain Support Points. \n3. There are different thresholds for Support Points. Once reached, they grant different bonus effects to all members in the camp. \n4. These bonus effects last until the conquest for the corresponding territory ends. \n5. After the territorial conquest ends, extra rewards will be granted to survivors who provided support based on the Camp Advancement Point rankings of their supported camps.
<color=#fee685>Support Points Details: </color> The effects of reaching different support thresholds are as follows: \n1. 2,500 Support Points: +2% DEF\n2. 6,000 Support Points: +4% DEF\n3. 11,000 Support Points: +6% DEF\n4. 16,000 Support Points: +8% DEF\n5. 21,000 Support Points: +10% DEF
1. Once the territorial conquest ends. Extra rewards will be sent via mail to survivors who provided support based on the Camp Advancement Point rankings of their supported camps. \n2. Extra rewards calculation: Basic reward (based on supported camp's Advancement Point ranking) x the No. of supports
