<color=#fee685>Details: </color>\n1. Complete quests to earn Personal Points and Camp Points. Camp Points is the sum of Personal Points of all camp members. You will be able to claim higher Grade rewards as your camp progress in Tiers. Grade 10, 11, 12, 13, and 14 rewards will be available as your camp reach Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond, and Legend Tier in the event, respectively.  \n2. There are daily limits to the No. of quests each player can accept. Abandoned quests will not replenish limit count. The limit is based on your camp Tier, more specifically at 5, 5, 6, 6, 7, and 8 with Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond, and Legend Tier, respectively. Upon reaching gold Tier, the camp leader can abandon and refresh quests. A maximum of 10 quests can be refreshed. \n3. You cannot accept for complete quests within 24 hours after joining a new camp alliance. When you leave your current camp alliance, your quests are automatically abandoned. \n4. When the event ends, your camps may be promoted or demoted depending on its ranking. Your camp and personal rewards will also be calculated and sent to your mailbox along with any unclaimed reward. \n5. Camps from all servers are randomly matched against other camps of the same Tier. Based on total Camp Points, top 30% of camps are promoted and the bottom 20% camps are demoted.
