Co-op Invasion
<color=#fee685>A. Schedule</color>\nCo-op Invasion is available every Monday and Thursday at 7:20 pm server time.\n<color=#fee685>B. Eligibility</color>\n1. Co-op Invasion is a multilayer co-op mode. You can form a pre-existing team or join matchmaking on your own. \n2. Survivors who have challenged the mode at least 5 times, and meet the character level and home score requirements are eligible to participate. \n<color=#fee685>C. Matchmaking</color>\n1. A team can have a maximum number of 3 players. Exceeding this limit will prevent matchmaking. \n2. Each match will be based on the average of the highest power achieved by the 3 members of your/your opponent's team. \n3. When forming a team, the power of each team member needs to fall between 70%-130% of the average power of the team. \n4. The home camp scene will be determined by the player with the highest home score in the team for the current match. \n5. There will be no item drops from player deaths in the event. \n6. Dismantled Storage Crates will not drop any items. Dismantled Training Station or Essence Storages will not drop any LOST Essence. \n<color=#fee685>D. Points</color>\n1. Victory will be determined by the remaining camp dismantling progress bar of each side. The side with longer remaining bar wins the match. \n2. Dismantle enemy camp facilities to accumulate points, which are used for ranking players within the team to determine the end-of-match rewards. \n<color=#fee685>E. Improved Tools</color>\n1. In Co-op Invasion, tools deal 15% of the target building's max HP as extra damage.
