Ultimate Trial
Details:\n1. The Final Trial will feature different bosses daily for survivors to challenge. Each boss offers multiple difficulty levels, and the bosses become stronger as the difficulty increases. The difficulty level of each boss will be retained. Only the designated weapons can be used to challenge each boss.\n2. Each difficulty level of a boss includes multiple-stage rewards, which can be claimed after dealing a certain amount of damage to the boss in a single challenge. Defeating a boss unlocks the next difficulty level. \n3.Ranking rewards will be distributed daily based on the highest difficulty level and ranking achieved by survivors. \n4. Completing all difficulty levels for a boss unlocks Endless Mode.\n5. In Endless Mode, the boss cannot be defeated. Survivors should aim to deal as much damage as possible to earn ranking rewards. \n6. Survivor attributes will be adjusted in the Final Trial mode. \n7. At the start of each event run, you will receive 10 free challenge attempts. When a new difficulty level is unlocked, the free attempts will reset. Once the free attempts are exhausted, you can only challenge the current phase's Boss by spending Crystals.
